<description>&lt;p&gt;President De la Espriella faces renewed armed violence as Colombian military airstrikes killed five ELN rebels and a bombing hit a narcoterrorist site in Valle del Cauca. Thousands protested his tax plans and spending cuts across the country. The United States expanded military operations in Latin America, delivered a C-130 to Bogotá, and is being sued by Ecuadorian fishermen over a mysterious boat strike. ELN activity has spread into Venezuela. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQaVlsN2FuNE82VGp2ZXBmTF9Odkk0OU5waE5qUGdMZnRRNjRtQlVWaTg4encxV1NiMU9FTWh4TnVLc09DN1dLOWlRRHczUDBsWjEzdk9vdzY2N0VldVlXdTBSQXBha3pfb3RrMDE4LUctbHE4eWxxbXRLVktPM28wZlZrNWpQcVM1WHF0bEl4MXdpdTZONVBsUzkwMGxmRHFPNTBiaFQ1UDNKSjVkd2JqVlRqclkzUWVPX09qUGxn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOZnNiekFQZklSWm1tQ0xmMVJzMUZzdllkeXBSN0VoV1dWUk1lb0JXR0RwZlhjNEY2VlFBNW92aENEUjhWcGJRaG05cElRMUUyMVZsWVBYcVFXRVFkZFVOVFpLT250aVpCaTZiNzlwQjlfMWxEcDdpOHhxbnBJbUY0ZFFId0VFMXFPNWx0MlRHMlVzeENPWEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Apa.az&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQR2NISkdKcTBzeHNkM0VjUENxeVhKOVY4clAzWC16LVlxWmVJZHVIQzRSZ2plRmxvRWxhdUhkX2ZnbC1LdE1YX3Z5ZVJJVW5xb1RLc0w0OWExVzJDaGFzRk9iUThUS2ExQnE5Yk9KNThrUS1BeFo2dGl1QmkxbDgzMmkxN1BzdWNqeVlOVWYtZG0ydmVzeE4zSjFCa3lJdEFESVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Peninsula Qatar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxQT3h2OUhuVFVPVEN1NkhidU9nQUJraXNzMFdZNnluQ0dSOTlpUmlrOXlmZFY2MzczTzFXYlJwcDl6UXdLSkJQMTA3aEVlUHRmZ3RsZGlfVFdjMXVNVkdBem5GdE9VMkVqY3g5Tk9EOG5wRGxyY3NIRUcxNFhtdFVpcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demó